 this form.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NIELIT CCC Exam 2026 : Free Practice Paper ( हिन्दी )</strong></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Model Paper Set 1</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Total Question</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Link</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Set 1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NC3DEtRIOUzcoESGiSVmMtE1T6RVn1co/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Set 2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wQoFAzBTyeFTd_M73JumisNFv19GhZgH/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Set 3</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ywk7A_qcdw8zFW7Ej7xZ_J__7GNhHylv/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">Set 4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\">100</td>\n<td style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file